WIth no surprise, the word "kangre'o" is very similar to the latin "cancer"  
(which is also the name of the zodiacal sign) and many Italians would be  
able to relate it to "granchio" (or cancro, the zodiacal sign again) I  
suspect that other Latin-based languages might do the same.

I would have no clue on what a "braxiura" could be.

